  "description_short": "Award-winning coffee roastery and café serving specialty brews and hearty breakfasts in Mossel Bay's heart.",
  "description_long": "The Blue Shed Coffee Roastery has become a beloved fixture on Bland Street, where the aroma of freshly roasted beans greets you from the pavement. This working roastery doubles as a relaxed café, offering a rotating selection of single-origin coffees alongside classic espresso drinks prepared by passionate baristas who know their craft.\n\nThe menu focuses on generous breakfasts and light lunches that complement the coffee perfectly – think fluffy scrambled eggs, proper bacon sandwiches, and homemade pastries that pair beautifully with a flat white. The industrial-chic interior features exposed brick and communal tables that encourage lingering, while the small outdoor seating area catches the morning sun.\n\nLocated in central Mossel Bay, it's a five-minute walk from the harbour and makes an ideal stop before exploring the town's beaches and historical sites. The friendly service and commitment to quality coffee have earned it a loyal local following, and bags of their house-roasted beans make excellent gifts for coffee lovers back home.",
